  "translation": "Nois bilong amamas na nois bilong glasglas, nois bilong man marit na nois bilong meri marit, nois bilong ol i tok: Givim tenkyu long ⟨את⟩ Yahwe Tsebaot, bilong wanem Yahwe i gutpela, bilong wanem khesed bilong en i stap olgeta taim — ol i bringim ofa tenkyu i go insait long haus bilong Yahwe, bilong wanem bai mi brangkim bek ⟨את⟩ ol we ol i kalabus bilong graun, olsem long taim bipo. Olsem Yahwe i tok.",
